{"ticker":"RIVN","updated":"2026-11-20T23:17:09Z","profile":{"longName":"Rivian Automotive, Inc.","shortName":"Rivian Automotive, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Manufacturers","country":"United States","website":"https://www.rivian.com","fullTimeEmployees":15232,"marketCap":15080628224,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":-5.861026,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.3272574,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":17.74,"targetHighPrice":25.0,"targetLowPrice":10.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":25,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.383,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.09167,"operatingMargins":-0.52948004,"profitMargins":-0.45880002,"totalRevenue":6480000000,"beta":1.644,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":22.69,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":10.2842,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Rivian Automotive, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, develops, manufactures, and sells category-defining electric vehicles. It operates through two segments, Automotive, and Software and Services. The company offers consumer vehicles, including a two-row, five-passenger pickup truck under the R1T brand; and a three-row, seven-passenger sport utility vehicle under the R1S name. It also provides software and services, such as vehicle electrical architecture and software development, as well as Autonomy+, remarketing, vehicle repair and maintenance services, software subscriptions, vehicle accessories, financing, insurance, and other services. In addition, the company designs, develops, and manufactures the Rivian Adventure Network Direct Current fast chargers; and FleetOS, a proprietary, end-to-end centralized fleet management subscription platform. Further, it offers Rivian Commercial Van platform for Electric Delivery Van with collaboration with Amazon.com, Inc. Rivian Automotive, Inc. was founded in 2009 and is based in Irvine, California.","summary_zh":"Rivian Automotive, Inc. 及其子公司開發、製造和銷售定義類別的電動車。它透過兩個部門運作：汽車部門、軟體和服務部門。該公司提供消費性車輛，包括 R1T 品牌的兩排五座皮卡車；以及一輛名為 R1S 的三排七人座運動型多用途車。它還提供軟體和服務，例如車輛電氣架構和軟體開發，以及Autonomy+、再行銷、車輛維修和保養服務、軟體訂閱、車輛配件、融資、保險和其他服務。此外，該公司還設計、開發和製造Rivian Adventure Network直流快速充電器； FleetOS，一個專有的、端到端的集中式車隊管理訂閱平台。此外，它還與 Amazon.com, Inc. 合作，為電動送貨車提供 Rivian Commercial Van 平台。 Rivian Automotive, Inc. 成立於 2009 年，總部位於加州歐文市。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"汽車製造商","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":14.305,"h":15.43,"l":14.11,"c":15.24,"v":74244700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":15.245,"h":15.7,"l":14.99,"c":15.53,"v":53832600},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":15.51,"h":15.95,"l":15.064,"c":15.79,"v":50644500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":15.5,"h":16.05,"l":15.14,"c":15.74,"v":44793600},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":15.81,"h":16.17,"l":15.57,"c":15.59,"v":36800700},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":15.75,"h":15.79,"l":15.0,"c":15.25,"v":46005200},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":15.25,"h":15.51,"l":14.55,"c":14.68,"v":48572400},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":14.785,"h":15.06,"l":14.59,"c":14.61,"v":27345900},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":14.13,"h":14.15,"l":13.21,"c":13.53,"v":75952400},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":13.525,"h":13.73,"l":13.22,"c":13.65,"v":45879700},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":13.73,"h":13.9,"l":13.46,"c":13.5,"v":29514100},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":13.53,"h":13.72,"l":13.23,"c":13.26,"v":31711000},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":13.28,"h":13.4,"l":13.05,"c":13.13,"v":26798600},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":13.08,"h":13.17,"l":12.86,"c":13.09,"v":27776400},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":13.12,"h":13.2,"l":12.67,"c":12.8,"v":25834700},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":12.99,"h":13.12,"l":12.8,"c":13.06,"v":21988800},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":12.86,"h":13.27,"l":12.61,"c":13.12,"v":25298100},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":13.25,"h":13.638,"l":13.185,"c":13.41,"v":36082900},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":13.42,"h":13.42,"l":12.81,"c":12.91,"v":28327500},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":12.9,"h":13.215,"l":12.87,"c":13.03,"v":24003800},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":12.8,"h":13.15,"l":12.66,"c":13.08,"v":35626600},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":13.07,"h":13.56,"l":12.9,"c":13.2,"v":27959900},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":13.09,"h":13.25,"l":12.72,"c":12.92,"v":41848600},{"t":"2