Rivian 股票 (RIVN)"},{"title":"Rivian Automotive (RIVN) Lifted Guidance And Secured Funding, Is The Stock Still Cheap?","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-10","zh":""},{"title":"Will UBS Upgrade Change Rivian's (RIVN) Narrative","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-04","zh":""},{"title":"Rivian Automotive (RIVN) Shares Moved, So What Is Behind The Attention?","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-03","zh":"Rivian Automotive (RIVN) 股價變動，那麼關注背後的原因是什麼？"},{"title":"Rivian raises 2026 guidance after Q3 revenue growth","src":"Just Auto","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxQTmdrLUpuT196NVRSZDFpeXBoZ01qMkhrUldJVGpFS3FIYzZKUF84S2dqTmxHUGtvZzQyaG5jYV9WMVVQWENPUjhSLV9adFZfRzVJY2NXcUtNOHBBNkxrbExhc3dFclBCZHMzS0VKRTcwQ1NvZ1hBYTBxQmQ3NDhXNWVvSQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":""}],"themes":[{"name":"分析師評等","count":5},{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1874178/000187417826000008/rivn-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Rivian is an American automotive technology company that develops and manufactures category-defining electric vehicles as well as vertically integrated technologies and services. Through innovation across its electrical architecture, end-to-end software, autonomous driving platform, artificial intelligence, and propulsion, the Company creates vehicles that excel at work and play with the goal of accelerating the global transition to zero-emission transportation and energy. Rivian vehicles are manufactured in the United States and are sold directly to consumer and commercial customers. Whether taking families on new adventures or electrifying fleets at scale, Rivian vehicles all share a common goal — preserving the natural world for generations to come.","zh":"Rivian 是一家美國汽車技術公司，開發和製造定義類別的電動車以及垂直整合技術和服務。透過電氣架構、端到端軟體、自動駕駛平台、人工智慧和推進系統的創新，該公司創造出在工作和娛樂方面表現出色的車輛，目標是加速全球向零排放交通和能源的轉型。 Rivian 車輛在美國製造，直接銷售給消費者和商業客戶。無論是帶著家庭進行新的冒險還是大規模地為車隊提供電力，Rivian 車輛都有一個共同的目標——為子孫後代保護自然世界。"},{"en":"We believe our competitive advantage stems from our product and brand differentiation through vertically integrated technologies as well as our direct-to-customer sales and service model. Product performance benefits from the ability to fully control and continually enhance virtually every aspect of our vehicle's software, digital experience, and driving dynamics. Our in-house autonomy system has been designed with an AI-centric end-to-end approach and leverages the large amount of miles driven by Rivian vehicles for training, enabling the Company to continuously improve the system. We believe our product performance is increasingly being recognized by customers and has helped Rivian earn some of the industry's most coveted owner experience awards.","zh":"我們相信，我們的競爭優勢源自於我們透過垂直整合技術以及直接面向客戶的銷售和服務模式所實現的產品和品牌差異化。產品性能受益於完全控制和持續增強車輛軟體、數位體驗和駕駛動態的幾乎各個方面的能力。我們的內部自主系統採用以人工智慧為中心的端到端方法設計，並利用 Rivian 車輛的大量行駛里程進行訓練，使公司能夠不斷改進系統。我們相信我們的產品性能越來越受到客戶的認可，並幫助 Rivian 贏得了一些業內最令人垂涎​​的業主體驗獎。"},{"en":"Our zonal network architecture and software stack serves as the basis for Rivian and Volkswagen Group Technologies, LLC (the \"Joint Venture\"). The Joint Venture is working to develop industry-leading software-enabled features and capabilities to address global markets and segments across a variety of vehicle platforms.","zh":"我們的區域網路架構和軟體堆疊是 Rivian 和大眾集團技術有限責任公司（「合資企業」）的基礎。該合資公司致力於開發領先業界的軟體功能和功能，以滿足全球市場和跨各種車輛平台的細分市場的需求。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We launched our consumer vehicle business with the R1 platform consisting of two vehicles: the R1T, a two-row, five-passenger pickup truck, and the R1S, a three-row, seven-passenger sport utility vehicle (\"SUV\").","zh":"我們透過 R1 平台推出了消費汽車業務，該平台由兩種車輛組成：R1T（兩排五座皮卡車）和 R1S（三排七座運動型多用途車（「SUV」））。"},{"en":"The R1T and R1S are equipped with Rivian-designed technology including a zonal network architecture, electric powertrains and chassis, the Rivian Autonomy Platform, and digital user experience management via Connect+ which will include Rivian Assistant. These technologies can continuously improve and expand functionality through cloud-enabled over-the-air (\"OTA\") updates.","zh":"R1T 和 R1S 配備了 Rivian 設計的技術，包括區域網路架構、電動動力系統和底盤、Rivian Autonomy 平台以及透過 Connect+（其中包括 Rivian Assistant）進行的數位使用者體驗管理。這些技術可以透過支援雲端的無線（“OTA”）更新不斷改進和擴展功能。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Automotive","val":3830000000,"zh":"汽車"},{"name":"Software & Services","val":1557000000,"zh":"軟體與服務部門"}],"total":5387000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Automotive","val":3830000000,"zh":"汽車"},{"name":"Vehicles","val":3639000000,"zh":"車輛"},{"name":"Software & Services","val":1557000000,"zh":"軟體與服務"},{"name":"Software & Services Revenue","val":1551000000,"zh":"軟體和服務收入"},{"name":"Regulatory Credits","val":197000000,"zh":"監理積分"}],"total":5387000000}},"peers":["LCID","NIO","COIN","RBLX","QS"]}}